<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S3" title="In Cohomology and base change for algebraic stacks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">3 </span>Finitely generated and coherent functors</span></a></li>
