\end{picture}\ }\otimes_{\mathcal{O}_{X}}^{\mathsf{L}}\mathsf{L}{f}_{\mathrm{Q}}^{*}\mathcal{{{K}}}^{\,\begin{picture}(0.0,-2.0)\circle*{1.5}\end{picture}\ })</annotation></semantics></math></td>
