<li id="bib.bibx32" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_bibitem">[SGA6]</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">
<em id="bib.bibx32.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Théorie des intersections et théorème de Riemann-Roch</em>, Lecture
